{"type":"message","id":"173af017","parentId":"07693380","timestamp":"2026-03-26T07:23:23.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on the search results, it looks like there are several WeChat plugins for OpenClaw:\n\n1. `@fengcch/openclaw-wechat-access-plugin` - npm package for WeChat access\n2. `hillghost86/OpenClawWeChat` - GitHub repo for personal WeChat integration\n3. `ahaduoduoduo/openclaw-wechat-plugin` - WeChat channel plugin with macOS native notifications + Webhook\n\nAnd importantly, there's a recent development - WeChat launched \"ClawBot\" plugin on March 22, 2026, which is an official/native WeChat plugin that integrates with OpenClaw.\n\n\nI should walk through the options and help them get set up with whichever approach suits their needs best.","thinkingSignature":"64586f79437806398b00d304fedc185446c9e629f33d108ab9714b981ce6364a"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n好消息！找到了几个微信插件选项：\n\n**1. 微信官方 ClawBot（最新，3月22日刚推出）**\n微信官方出的插件，接入方式和\"文件传输助手\"一样，直接在微信里对话。需要更新微信到最新版本，然后在「我-设置-插件」里找安装指令。\n\n**2. openclaw-wechat-plugin（macOS 专用）**\n支持 macOS 原生通知 + Webhook 接收消息，AppleScript 自动发送。需要 Mac 上跑微信，适合桌面用户。\n\n**3. @fengcch/openclaw-wechat-access-plugin（npm 包）**\n终端扫码登录，全自动轮询。\n\n---\n\n频哥你想用哪个？\n- 如果你只是想在微信里跟我聊天，用 **ClawBot** 最简单\n- 如果你想实现更复杂的微信能力（桌面端），告诉我你用的是 Mac 还是 Windows，我帮你装对应的插件\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8506,"output":344,"cacheRead":35464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44314,"cost":{"input":0.0025518,"output":0.0004128,"cacheRead":0.0021278399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00509244}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774509789723,"responseId":"061411dfb40926da1d93706d56bef7e1"}}
