{"type":"message","id":"27bd2565","parentId":"102924ea","timestamp":"2026-03-26T07:24:20.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is on macOS. So the most appropriate plugin would be `openclaw-wechat-plugin` (ahaduoduoduo/openclaw-wechat-plugin) which supports macOS native notifications + Webhook for receiving messages and AppleScript UI automation for sending messages. Let me provide instructions for installing it.\n\nActually, looking at the plugins list, none of the WeChat plugins are in the available plugins list. They are not installed. I need to help the user install one. Let me check if these are available as npm packages or need to be installed from GitHub.\n\nThe `@fengcch/openclaw-wechat-access-plugin` is on npm, so that could be installed via `openclaw plugins add`.\n\n\nLet me verify the exact plugin names and installation method. I'll try installing the npm package first, and if that doesn't work, I can attempt the GitHub repository as a fallback.","thinkingSignature":"1547ec3210ce2205f1a1f1538e784a65d461e63526737c03ffda3a011aab1c6d"},{"type":"text","text":"好，Mac 用户推荐用 **openclaw-wechat-plugin**（支持 macOS 通知 + AppleScript 发送）。让我试试直接装：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1e332ndn24ae_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw plugins add ahaduoduoduo/openclaw-wechat-plugin 2>&1","timeout":60}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":157,"output":265,"cacheRead":35890,"cacheWrite":8110,"totalTokens":44422,"cost":{"input":0.0000471,"output":0.000318,"cacheRead":0.0021533999999999998,"cacheWrite":0.00304125,"total":0.0055597500000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774509846105,"responseId":"06141218421c87b00b9344bfeaf59048"}}
