{"type":"message","id":"4beb8560","parentId":"a4911f7b","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:23:22.580Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill `language-learning-tutor` is in the extensions folder but not recognized by the skills system. Let me look at what's in the SKILL.md file to understand what it is. Maybe it needs to be installed differently.","thinkingSignature":"09b5d2bba6cbd5804bea64b52e7d024122094529789c2460969a126e85d6147f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0vnjmur0alzf_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/language-learning-tutor/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":84005,"output":89,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119808,"cost":{"input":0.025201499999999998,"output":0.0001068,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02745114}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774534993432,"responseId":"06147452b3dc85fe055b1ae91ccb8cdc"}}
{"type":"message","id":"91cdf512","parentId":"4beb8560","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:23:22.617Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0vnjmur0alzf_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: language-learning-tutor\ndescription: 多语言 AI 导师技能。支持从零基础到高级的各语种学习，包含词汇构建、语法讲解、会话练习、闪卡训练、文字系统学习、文化语境和考试备考。当用户请求学习外语、练习对话、背单词、学语法、准备语言考试（如JLPT、HSK、DELE、TOPIK等）时触发。\n---\n\n# Language Learning Tutor 🌍\n\n## 快速开始\n\n直接告诉我：\n- **目标语言** — 想学什么语言？有无特定方言？\n- **当前水平** — 零基础/初学者/初级/中级/中高级/高级\n- **学习目标** — 旅行/会话/职场/学术/文化/好玩\n- **偏好风格** — 对话式/结构化/沉浸式/混合\n\n## 教学模式\n\n### 1. 词汇构建器\n主题分组教学，每词格式：\n- [目标语言] — [音标] — [中文含义]\n- 例句 + 翻译\n- 记忆技巧\n\n学完5-7词后测验（识别/回忆/填空）\n\n### 2. 语法课\n通过例句找规律：\n- 展示3-4个例句\n- 引导发现规律\n- 清晰解释规则\n- 练习造句\n\n### 3. 会话练习\n模拟真实场景：\n- 设定场景\n- 目标语言开始\n- 温和纠错\n- 对话后总结\n\n### 4. 闪卡训练\n间隔重复高效记忆：\n- 第1轮：展示10个\n- 第2轮：测验标记\n- 第3轮：重测错题+新内容\n- 第4轮：全部回顾\n\n### 5. 文字系统（可选）\n非拉丁字母专项：\n- 日语：Hiragana → Katakana → Kanji\n- 中文：拼音 → 基础汉字\n- 韩语：Hangul 系统\n- 阿拉伯：字母 + 元音\n- 俄语：Cyrillic\n\n### 6. 文化语境\n礼貌级别、禁忌、俚语、食文化、节日\n\n### 7. 考试冲刺\n针对认证：JLPT / HSK / DELE / TOPIK / DELF 等\n\n## 支持语言\n\n**Tier 1**：Spanish、French、German、Italian、Portuguese、Japanese、Chinese、Korean、Arabic、Hindi、Bengali、Russian、Turkish、Vietnamese、Thai、Dutch、Polish、Swedish、Greek、Hebrew 等\n\n**Tier 2**：Urdu、Persian、Tamil、Telugu、Marathi、Gujarati 等\n\n**Tier 3**：任何其他语言，包括手语、古典语言、世界语\n\n---\n\n想学什么语言？告诉我你的目标，我们开始上课 🎓\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774535002614}}
