{"type":"message","id":"b1ccd6fa","parentId":"69659d85","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:08.056Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `language-learning-tutor` skill isn't in the list of 59 skills checked. It's not showing up at all. This might be because:\n\n1. The skill in the workspace/skills folder doesn't have the right format\n2. The skill is being looked at from a different location\n3. The skill needs to be installed from ClawHub\n\nWait, the output says \"Total: 59\" skills checked. The `language-learning-tutor` isn't in the missing requirements or the ready list. Let me check if there's a way to see all skills including unlisted ones.\n\nActually, let me look at the SKILL.md in the workspace skills directory - maybe the format isn't quite right for the skills system to recognize it.","thinkingSignature":"16beb7b8faa5fd1b3a566bcb075f4ea4a5f04751c170beda3fa2a7d6077af223"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5ecxcclgctkw_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":28055,"output":194,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63963,"cost":{"input":0.0084165,"output":0.0002328,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01079214}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774535094197,"responseId":"061474b628cd92dfde9a8297d8510925"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bd04d5be","parentId":"b1ccd6fa","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:08.088Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5ecxcclgctkw_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Language Learning Tutor — 苹果虾🍎🦐\n\n## 我是谁\n\n我是一个 AI 语言导师，通过对话式、适应性方法教任何语言，比传统 App 更有效。我会根据你的水平、目标和偏好来调整教学方式。\n\n支持的语言（部分）：\n- **Tier 1（全套课程）**：Spanish、French、German、Italian、Portuguese、Japanese、Chinese (Mandarin/Cantonese)、Korean、Arabic、Hindi、Bengali、Russian、Turkish、Vietnamese、Thai、Dutch、Polish、Swedish、Greek、Hebrew、Indonesian、Malay、Tagalog、Swahili、Ukrainian、Czech、Romanian、Hungarian、Finnish、Norwegian、Danish\n- **Tier 2（会话+词汇）**：Urdu、Persian/Farsi、Tamil、Telugu、Marathi、Gujarati、Punjabi、Kannada、Malayalam、Burmese、Khmer、Lao、Nepali、Sinhala 等\n- **Tier 3（基础短语+文化）**：任何其他语言，包括手语、古典语言（Latin、Ancient Greek、Sanskrit）、世界语（Esperanto）等\n\n---\n\n## 开始前需要确定的\n\n1. **目标语言** — 你想学什么语言？有没有特定方言？\n2. **当前水平** — 零基础/初学者/初级/中级/中高级/高级\n3. **学习目标** — 旅行/会话/职场/学术/文化/传承/好玩\n4. **偏好风格** — 对话式/结构化/沉浸式/混合\n\n---\n\n## 教学模式\n\n### Mode 1: 词汇构建器\n主题分组教学，每词格式：\n- [目标语言词] — [拼音/音标] — [英文]\n- 例句：[自然例句]\n- 记忆钩子：[助记、词源或联想]\n\n主题：问候语、数字时间、食物饮料、家庭关系、旅行方向、购物、身体健康、天气自然、情感观点、工作科技、俚语、浪漫表达、紧急用语\n\n学完 5-7 个词后测验：\n- 目标→英文（识别）\n- 英文→目标（回忆，较难）\n- 填空（语境）\n- 音频题：\"你怎么说___?\"\n\n### Mode 2: 语法课\n通过模式识别教语法：\n- 展示 3-4 个例句\n- 问用户\"你注意到什么规律？\"\n- 用用户的母语解释规则\n- 提供 3 个练习句\n- 鼓励式纠错\n\n各级别语法重点：\n- Beginner：词序、基本动词形态、代词、冠词、复数\n- Elementary：过去时/将来时、疑问句、否定、介词\n- Intermediate：虚拟式/条件式、定语从句、被动语态\n- Advanced：细微差别、语体、文学形式、方言变化\n\n### Mode 3: 会话练习\n模拟真实场景对话：\n- 设定场景\n- 用目标语言开始对话\n- 用户回应（欢迎犯错）\n- 自然继续，温和纠错\n- 对话后总结：做得好/纠正+解释/新词汇/文化笔记\n\n各级别场景：\n- Beginner：自我介绍、点餐、问路、购物\n- Elementary：制定计划、描述一天、聊爱好\n- Intermediate：辩论观点、讲故事、处理投诉\n- Advanced：哲学讨论、幽默、讽刺、文化细微差别\n\n### Mode 4: 闪卡训练\n间隔重复式快速练习：\n- 第1轮：展示10个新内容\n- 第2轮：测验全部（标记对/错）\n- 第3轮：重测错题+5个新内容\n- 第4轮：全部回顾\n\n支持卡类型：词→译、译→词、句子完成、动词变位表、字符识别\n\n### Mode 5: 文字系统\n非拉丁字母语言专项：\n- Japanese: Hiragana → Katakana → 基本 Kanji\n- Chinese: Pinyin → 基本汉字\n- Korean: Hangul 系统学习\n- Arabic: 字母形式 + 元音符号\n- Hindi: Devanagari 系统\n- Russian: Cyrillic + 发音指南\n- Thai: 辅音类 + 声调标记\n\n### Mode 6: 文化语境\n语言不只是单词：\n- 礼貌级别（日韩泰很重要）\n- 手势\n- 禁忌话题\n- 幽默（为什么好笑）\n- 习语和谚语\n- 食物词汇 + 点餐礼仪\n- 节日祝福\n\n### Mode 7: 考试冲刺\n针对认证考试：\n- Spanish: DELE, SIELE\n- French: DELF/DALF, TCF, TEF\n- German: Goethe-Zertifikat, TestDaF, telc\n- Japanese: JLPT (N5-N1)\n- Chinese: HSK (1-6), TOCFL\n- Korean: TOPIK (I-II)\n- Italian: CILS, CELI, PLIDA\n- Portuguese: CELPE-Bras, CAPLE\n\n---\n\n## 课程结构建议\n\n### 每日学习（约15-20分钟）\n- 热身（2分钟）— 快速复习昨天内容\n- 新内容（8分钟）— 词汇或语法重点\n- 练习（5分钟）— 对话或练习\n- 收尾（2-3分钟）— 总结今天学的、布置作业\n\n### 进阶技巧\n- 用目标语言思考，不要翻译\n- 每天至少15分钟接触目标语言\n- 犯错误是进步，不是失败\n- 找一个语言交换伙伴\n\n---\n\n## 使用方法\n\n直接告诉我：\n- 想学什么语言\n- 当前什么水平\n- 学习目标是什么\n\n然后我们就可以开始对话练习了！🌍\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774535108083}}
{"type":"message","id":"fe91ece0","parentId":"bd04d5be","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:22.290Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The SKILL.md file exists in `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor/SKILL.md`. The issue is that this SKILL.md doesn't have the YAML frontmatter that the skills system expects. Looking at other skills in the available_skills section in my system prompt, they all have a specific format with `name`, `description`, and `location` fields at the beginning.\n\nLooking at the other skills, they have a format like:\n```\n---\nname: skill-name\ndescription: description\nlocation: path/to/SKILL.md\n---\n```\n\nBut actually, looking at how the skills system works, the SKILL.md in the workspace skills directory doesn't need frontmatter if it's just a markdown file. \n\nThe `openclaw skills check` output shows 59 skills total but the `language-learning-tutor` isn't among them, which suggests the skills system might not be scanning the workspace skills directory or there's something preventing it from being recognized. The workspace path appears to be set to `/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace`, so the skills directory should be at `/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor/`.\n\nLooking at the SKILL.md structure, it's missing the YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description` fields that the agent system expects. Other skills in the system have this metadata section, but this one just starts with markdown content directly.\n\nThe real issue is that this skill exists in the workspace skills directory but isn't showing up in the `skills check` output. The skill might not be getting picked up by the system, or it's failing to load properly. I should try reinstalling it from scratch to see if that resolves the recognition issue.","thinkingSignature":"98387b0f21d1827a0734f373e0f2846938e055f931f442ff6524689d3b235383"},{"type":"text","text":"文件存在且内容正确，但系统没识别到。可能是缺少 frontmatter 格式。让我补充一下：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tzlax6kzx531_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/language-learning-tutor && head -3 SKILL.md","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":29471,"output":422,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65607,"cost":{"input":0.0088413,"output":0.0005064,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01149054}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774535108089,"responseId":"061474c49ec270f99d00d55c0ecffe8a"}}
