{"type":"message","id":"42757602","parentId":"a1e5fb8f","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:29.796Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The SKILL.md doesn't have YAML frontmatter. Let me check what the other skills look like in the workspace directory to understand the expected format.\n\nActually wait - I should also check the other skills in the workspace to see if they have frontmatter or not.\n\nActually, looking at the AGENTS.md, it says skills go in the workspace and have a SKILL.md. The frontmatter might be optional for some skills but required for others.\n\nLet me look at how the skills system identifies skills. Maybe the issue is that the workspace skills are only loaded from a specific directory structure.\n\nActually, let me try a different approach - maybe the skill needs to be in a specific format. Let me look at the skill-creator skill to understand the format.","thinkingSignature":"1236d48ad0e6d96e46690c934e3359efa8048f1a6f353afeb98557a23e700c77"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q7p2rz9wdtxx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"head -10 /usr/local/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/skill-creator/SKILL.md","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":29924,"output":207,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65845,"cost":{"input":0.0089772,"output":0.00024839999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011368439999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774535122328,"responseId":"061474d2a8bb613b84df7b9bff543eb7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fec54791","parentId":"42757602","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:29.834Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_q7p2rz9wdtxx_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: skill-creator\ndescription: Create, edit, improve, or audit AgentSkills. Use when creating a new skill from scratch or when asked to improve, review, audit, tidy up, or clean up an existing skill or SKILL.md file. Also use when editing or restructuring a skill directory (moving files to references/ or scripts/, removing stale content, validating against the AgentSkills spec). Triggers on phrases like \"create a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"tidy up a skill\", \"improve this skill\", \"review the skill\", \"clean up the skill\", \"audit the skill\".\n---\n\n# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":11,"aggregated":"---\nname: skill-creator\ndescription: Create, edit, improve, or audit AgentSkills. Use when creating a new skill from scratch or when asked to improve, review, audit, tidy up, or clean up an existing skill or SKILL.md file. Also use when editing or restructuring a skill directory (moving files to references/ or scripts/, removing stale content, validating against the AgentSkills spec). Triggers on phrases like \"create a skill\", \"author a skill\", \"tidy up a skill\", \"improve this skill\", \"review the skill\", \"clean up the skill\", \"audit the skill\".\n---\n\n# Skill Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for creating effective skills.\n\n## About Skills","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774535129829}}
