{"type":"message","id":"1fd7e20a","parentId":"9d711e09","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:25:51.173Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `language-learning-tutor` skill is now showing as \"✓ ready\" and is categorized as \"openclaw-workspace\". \n\nNow let me inform the user.","thinkingSignature":"8b71f7d8d868ea405dd6da882d4e44459dbb1dcb69a074d846bc3b311e4a9ae6"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n✅ **英语学习技能已装好并激活了！**\n\n`language-learning-tutor` 状态：`✓ ready`\n\n功能包括：\n- 词汇构建器\n- 语法讲解\n- 会话练习\n- 闪卡训练\n- 文字系统（ alphabets）\n- 文化语境\n- 考试冲刺（JLPT、HSK、DELE 等）\n\n想学什么语言？告诉我你的目标和水平，我们开始 🎓\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":30678,"output":135,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66527,"cost":{"input":0.009203399999999999,"output":0.00016199999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01150824}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774535146057,"responseId":"061474ea4f5dc6c7d647d6538a694a25"}}
