{"type":"message","id":"5d03ae15","parentId":"5be2df73","timestamp":"2026-03-26T14:59:04.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I got the changelog from the local CHANGELOG.md file. Let me summarize the key changes in version 2026.3.24 for the user.","thinkingSignature":"0901ab5314f19f80ba7619ca55a58a2c0059eaba2faf69d004b831ed1b2551a8"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n找到了！**2026.3.24** 的主要更新：\n\n**亮点功能：**\n- 🆕 **OpenAI 兼容接口升级** — 新增 `/v1/models` 和 `/v1/embeddings`，支持更广泛的客户端和 RAG 兼容\n- 🛠️ **Microsoft Teams 全面重构** — 迁移到官方 SDK，支持消息编辑/删除、streaming 回复、欢迎卡片、typing indicators 等\n- 📦 **Skills 一键安装** — 新增依赖安装指引，技能缺少什么会直接告诉你去哪获取 API key\n- 🐋 **Docker/Container 支持** — 新增 `--container` 和 `OPENCLAW_CONTAINER` 直接在容器里跑命令\n- 💬 **Discord 自动线程** — 新增 LLM 生成线程标题功能\n- 🔗 **Plugin Hooks** — 新增 `before_dispatch` hook\n\n**界面改进：**\n- Control UI 的 Skills 页面增加状态过滤标签（All / Ready / Needs Setup / Disabled）\n- Workspace 文件预览支持更丰富的 Markdown 渲染\n- macOS app 配置导航改成可折叠树形侧边栏\n\n**Bug 修复（较重要）：**\n- 🔒 安全修复：修复了媒体文件路径绕过沙箱限制的问题\n- WhatsApp 群组消息回声抑制恢复正常\n- Telegram 照片发送在尺寸无效时改用文档发送\n- 飞书 WebSocket 僵尸连接问题\n- Gateway 重启后 session 恢复机制改进\n\n**另外提示：** 你现在的版本是 **2026.3.23**，需要更新到 2026.3.24。要我帮你更新吗？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":37517,"output":387,"cacheRead":35714,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73618,"cost":{"input":0.011255099999999999,"output":0.00046439999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00214284,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013862339999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774537131353,"responseId":"06147cab399e7a15b49f34ae0caf5b6d"}}
