{"type":"message","id":"8d0ffcb3","parentId":"b652509f","timestamp":"2026-03-26T15:09:03.208Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_mp4f5ttb6op4_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.3.24); current version is 2026.3.23.\n🧩 coding-agent △ Needs setup\n\nDelegate coding tasks to Codex, Claude Code, or Pi agents via background process. Use when: (1) building/creating new features or apps, (2) reviewing PRs (spawn in temp dir), (3) refactoring large codebases, (4) iterative coding that needs file exploration. NOT for: simple one-liner fixes (just edit), reading code (use read tool), thread-bound ACP harness requests in chat (for example spawn/run Codex or Claude Code in a Discord thread; use sessions_spawn with runtime:\"acp\"), or any work in ~/clawd workspace (never spawn agents here). Claude Code: use --print --permission-mode bypassPermissions (no PTY). Codex/Pi/OpenCode: pty:true required.\n\nDetails:\n  Source: openclaw-bundled\n  Path: /usr/local/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent/SKILL.md\n\nRequirements:\n  Any binaries: ✗ claude, ✗ codex, ✗ opencode, ✗ pi\n\nInstall options:\n  → Install @anthropic-ai/claude-code (npm)\n\nTip: use `openclaw skills search`, `openclaw skills install`, and `openclaw skills update` for ClawHub-backed skills."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":7577,"aggregated":"Config was last written by a newer OpenClaw (2026.3.24); current version is 2026.3.23.\n🧩 coding-agent △ Needs setup\n\nDelegate coding tasks to Codex, Claude Code, or Pi agents via background process. Use when: (1) building/creating new features or apps, (2) reviewing PRs (spawn in temp dir), (3) refactoring large codebases, (4) iterative coding that needs file exploration. NOT for: simple one-liner fixes (just edit), reading code (use read tool), thread-bound ACP harness requests in chat (for example spawn/run Codex or Claude Code in a Discord thread; use sessions_spawn with runtime:\"acp\"), or any work in ~/clawd workspace (never spawn agents here). Claude Code: use --print --permission-mode bypassPermissions (no PTY). Codex/Pi/OpenCode: pty:true required.\n\nDetails:\n  Source: openclaw-bundled\n  Path: /usr/local/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent/SKILL.md\n\nRequirements:\n  Any binaries: ✗ claude, ✗ codex, ✗ opencode, ✗ pi\n\nInstall options:\n  → Install @anthropic-ai/claude-code (npm)\n\nTip: use `openclaw skills search`, `openclaw skills install`, and `openclaw skills update` for ClawHub-backed skills.","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774537743203}}
