{"type":"message","id":"15acf52e","parentId":"cc873d71","timestamp":"2026-03-26T15:21:01.484Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_2qa274r5kijz_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Codex CLI\n\nIf no subcommand is specified, options will be forwarded to the interactive CLI.\n\nUsage: codex [OPTIONS] [PROMPT]\n       codex [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]\n\nCommands:\n  exec        Run Codex non-interactively [aliases: e]\n  review      Run a code review non-interactively\n  login       Manage login\n  logout      Remove stored authentication credentials\n  mcp         Manage external MCP servers for Codex\n  mcp-server  Start Codex as an MCP server (stdio)\n  app-server  [experimental] Run the app server or related tooling\n  app         Launch the Codex desktop app (downloads the macOS installer if missing)\n  completion  Generate shell completion scripts\n  sandbox     Run commands within a Codex-provided sandbox\n  debug       Debugging tools\n  apply       Apply the latest diff produced by Codex agent as a `git apply` to your local working"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":187,"aggregated":"Codex CLI\n\nIf no subcommand is specified, options will be forwarded to the interactive CLI.\n\nUsage: codex [OPTIONS] [PROMPT]\n       codex [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]\n\nCommands:\n  exec        Run Codex non-interactively [aliases: e]\n  review      Run a code review non-interactively\n  login       Manage login\n  logout      Remove stored authentication credentials\n  mcp         Manage external MCP servers for Codex\n  mcp-server  Start Codex as an MCP server (stdio)\n  app-server  [experimental] Run the app server or related tooling\n  app         Launch the Codex desktop app (downloads the macOS installer if missing)\n  completion  Generate shell completion scripts\n  sandbox     Run commands within a Codex-provided sandbox\n  debug       Debugging tools\n  apply       Apply the latest diff produced by Codex agent as a `git apply` to your local working","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774538461481}}
